'''Singularity''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Platinum Sceptre}}.

==Modifiers==
This sceptre applies the [[Hinder]] debuff on nearby enemies, and increases the wielder's damage dealt to them.

The radius of the Singularity item aura is 35.<ref name="HinderRadius"/> It cannot be altered with [[modifier]]s to [[area of effect]] because the aura is a property of the item, not a character.<ref name="MechanicalQs"/>

